    description: "Phoenix route_handler suffix scan fails when router uses custom aliases (alias MyAppWeb.UserController, as: UserCtrl). The Elixir analyzer already parses as: directives via _extract_alias_hints but the output is not fed into route metadata. Fix: pass alias map to _extract_phoenix_routes so controller field stores the resolved FQ name. Also parent of INV-nimik (Route-to-Handler Edge Completeness)."  # 2cc5
